                    the milk to the supplying farm or farms.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="section-badge">
                💰
            </div>

        </div>


        <% if (visibleFarmData.length === 0) { %>

            <p class="empty-state">
                No milk-producing farms are available for sale.
            </p>

        <% } else { %>


            <form
                action="/milk/sales/sell"
                method="POST"
                id="milkSaleForm"
            >

                <input
                    type="hidden"
                    name="day"
                    value="<%= pageDay %>"
